# Build context filter for core/site/Dockerfile: the image needs core/site's sources and the app manifest's
# JSON Schema (served under /schemas/, #87), @asafarim/theme's browser files and @asafarim/locale's languages and
# selector only.
*
!core/site/package.json
!core/site/src
!core/site/public
!core/site/nginx.conf
!packages/app-manifest/schema/app-manifest.schema.json
!packages/theme/theme.css
!packages/theme/theme.js
!packages/theme/toggle.html
!packages/locale/selector.js
!packages/locale/selector.css
!packages/locale/src/index.ts
